{
  "note": "Synthetic server frames for what the recording (S08-live) lacks: failed handshake steps, by-sid and routed chat, other channels and apps, names, extra items, XML bodies, malformed packets and frames. A session for topSid/subSid and uuid begins the handshake, then consumes each frame of a case in order; \"prelude\": true puts the frames of \"prelude\" (anonymous login, AP login, join) first. A frame is a list of packets, concatenated. Packet types, with the defaults of 3.x's tests (legacy/test/yy_protocol_test.dart): \"login\" (778500: envelope 0, realUri 20078, result 0, uid32 5, uid64 4294967301 or none when null, username, password, cookie [1,2,3]; \"payloadHex\" replaces the payload), \"ap\" (775940: appId 259, result 200, context \"259:0\"), \"join\" (512011 with realUri 2048514 and code 0: topSid, subSid, status 4, error \"\"; \"emptyPayload\" sends none), \"chat\" (app 31's 3104600 via \"group\" 533080, \"bySid\" 28760 or \"router\" 512011: topSid, subSid, text, color, nick (null: no name part), extras [[key, text]], innerUri, lengthDelta added to the chat block length), \"pong\" (794372) and \"hex\" (raw bytes). Names and texts are made up.",
  "topSid": 22490906,
  "subSid": 22490906,
  "uuid": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "prelude": [
    [{"type": "login"}],
    [{"type": "ap"}],
    [{"type": "join"}]
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "anonymous login, AP login and channel join in order",
      "frames": [
        [{"type": "login"}],
        [{"type": "ap"}],
        [{"type": "join"}]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "the router joins another room",
      "frames": [
        [{"type": "login"}],
        [{"type": "ap"}],
        [{"type": "join", "topSid": 22490907}]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "the router joins another sub channel",
      "frames": [
        [{"type": "login"}],
        [{"type": "ap"}],
        [{"type": "join", "subSid": 22490907}]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "the join is refused with a status and a reason",
      "frames": [
        [{"type": "login"}],
        [{"type": "ap"}],
        [{"type": "join", "status": 10, "error": "频道已关闭"}]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "the join is refused with a status only",
      "frames": [
        [{"type": "login"}],
        [{"type": "ap"}],
        [{"type": "join", "status": 10}]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "the join route fails",
      "frames": [
        [{"type": "login"}],
        [{"type": "ap"}],
        [{"type": "join", "code": 500, "emptyPayload": true}]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "another routed answer fails without failing the join",
      "frames": [
        [{"type": "login"}],
        [{"type": "ap"}],
        [{"type": "join", "realUri": 2048515, "code": 500, "emptyPayload": true}],
        [{"type": "join"}]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "anonymous login answers another protocol",
      "frames": [[{"type": "login", "realUri": 20079}]]
    },
    {
      "name": "anonymous login is refused",
      "frames": [[{"type": "login", "result": 1}]]
    },
    {
      "name": "anonymous login envelope is refused",
      "frames": [[{"type": "login", "envelope": 500}]]
    },
    {
      "name": "anonymous login without a 64-bit uid uses the 32-bit one",
      "frames": [
        [{"type": "login", "uid64": null, "uid32": 7}],
        [{"type": "ap"}],
        [{"type": "join"}]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "anonymous login without any uid is refused",
      "frames": [[{"type": "login", "uid64": null, "uid32": 0}]]
    },
    {
      "name": "anonymous login with a truncated payload fails the handshake",
      "frames": [[{"type": "login", "payloadHex": "000000000000"}]]
    },
    {
      "name": "AP login is refused",
      "frames": [
        [{"type": "login"}],
        [{"type": "ap", "result": 403}]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "answers out of order are ignored",
      "frames": [
        [{"type": "ap"}],
        [{"type": "join"}],
        [{"type": "login"}],
        [{"type": "login"}],
        [{"type": "ap"}],
        [{"type": "ap"}],
        [{"type": "join"}],
        [{"type": "join"}]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "chat before the join is ignored",
      "frames": [
        [{"type": "login"}],
        [{"type": "ap"}],
        [{"type": "chat", "text": "太早了"}]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "chat after the join, another room's dropped",
      "prelude": true,
